	"FriendlyName": "Exposure Probe",
	"Description": "暴露探针：在关卡中放置 T/CT 探针，按眼位到身体采样点的射线计算双向可见身体比例与暴露不对称度 A；改动后只重算受影响的射线，报告变化的探针对与新增单向视线；附地面热力图、烟雾评估（CC/RT）与版本基线对比。 Place T/CT probes and measure, from eye to body sample points, the visible body share in each direction and the exposure asymmetry A. Edits recast only the affected rays. Includes a floor heatmap, smoke evaluation (CC/RT) and baseline comparison.",
	"Category": "Level Design",
